# Webinar Recording: Unlocking the Power of Analytics in Care Coordination

**Date:** January 20, 2026
**Presenter:** Sarah Chen, CPO

## Description

In this webinar, Sarah Chen, our Chief Product Officer, provides a sneak peek of the upcoming MedSync Analytics Suite. She demonstrates how hospitals can use data-driven insights to improve patient outcomes and reduce costs.

## Key Takeaways

- The importance of analytics in care coordination
- How predictive models can identify high-risk patients
- Real-world examples of hospitals using analytics to drive results

